{"dialogue": {"lines": [{"en": "Happy Lohri! Keep warm by the fire!", "hi": "लोहड़ी मुबारक! आग सेंको!", "r": "Lohri diyan vadhaiyan! Agg seko!", "sp": "Neighbour", "t": "ਲੋਹੜੀ ਦੀਆਂ ਵਧਾਈਆਂ! ਅੱਗ ਸੇਕੋ!"}, {"en": "Same to you! Come, eat rewri.", "hi": "तुम्हें भी! आओ, रेवड़ी खाओ।", "r": "Tuhanu vi! Aao, revrhi khao.", "sp": "Mother", "t": "ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਵੀ! ਆਓ, ਰੇਵੜੀ ਖਾਓ।"}, {"en": "The bonfire looks beautiful!", "hi": "अलाव सुंदर लग रहा है!", "r": "Alav sohna lag riha hai!", "sp": "Neighbour", "t": "ਅਲਾਅ ਸੋਹਣਾ ਲੱਗ ਰਿਹਾ ਹੈ!"}, {"en": "In the evening there is bhangra.", "hi": "शाम को भंगड़ा है।", "r": "Sham nu bhangra hai.", "sp": "Mother", "t": "ਸ਼ਾਮ ਨੂੰ ਭੰਗੜਾ ਹੈ।"}, {"en": "We'll all come. Wear new clothes!", "hi": "हम सब आएँगे। नए कपड़े पहनना!", "r": "Asin sare avange. Naven kappre pao!", "sp": "Neighbour", "t": "ਅਸੀਂ ਸਾਰੇ ਆਵਾਂਗੇ। ਨਵੇਂ ਕੱਪੜੇ ਪਾਓ!"}], "title": "Lohri greetings"}, "lede": "Lohri, Baisakhi and Gurpurab — Punjabi for celebrations.", "phrases": [{"en": "Happy festival!", "hi": "त्यौहार मुबारक!", "r": "Tiuhar diyan vadhaiyan!", "t": "ਤਿਉਹਾਰ ਦੀਆਂ ਵਧਾਈਆਂ!"}, {"en": "Happy New Year!", "hi": "नया साल मुबारक!", "r": "Naven saal diyan vadhaiyan!", "t": "ਨਵੇਂ ਸਾਲ ਦੀਆਂ ਵਧਾਈਆਂ!"}, {"en": "Come to our house", "hi": "हमारे घर आओ", "r": "Sade ghar aao", "t": "ਸਾਡੇ ਘਰ ਆਓ"}, {"en": "Eat sweets", "hi": "मिठाई खाओ", "r": "Mithiai khao", "t": "ਮਿਠਿਆਈ ਖਾਓ"}, {"en": "Wear new clothes", "hi": "नए कपड़े पहनो", "r": "Naven kappre pao", "t": "ਨਵੇਂ ਕੱਪੜੇ ਪਾਓ"}, {"en": "Light the lamp", "hi": "दीया जलाओ", "r": "Diva balo", "t": "ਦੀਵਾ ਬਾਲੋ"}, {"en": "Offer prayers", "hi": "अरदास करो", "r": "Ardas karo", "t": "ਅਰਦਾਸ ਕਰੋ"}, {"en": "Go to the gurdwara", "hi": "गुरुद्वारे जाओ", "r": "Gurduare jao", "t": "ਗੁਰਦੁਆਰੇ ਜਾਓ"}, {"en": "Happy Diwali!", "hi": "दीवाली मुबारक!", "r": "Divali diyan vadhaiyan!", "t": "ਦੀਵਾਲੀ ਦੀਆਂ ਵਧਾਈਆਂ!"}], "quiz": [{"a": "festival", "explain": "ਤਿਉਹਾਰ (tiuhar) = festival.", "id": "pj-75", "lesson": "festivals", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["festival", "fast", "fair", "temple"], "q": "ਤਿਉਹਾਰ means…", "topic": "festivals", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "ਵਿਸਾਖੀ ਦਾ ਮੇਲਾ", "explain": "ਵਿਸਾਖੀ ਦਾ ਮੇਲਾ — the Baisakhi harvest fair!", "id": "pj-76", "lesson": "festivals", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["ਵਿਸਾਖੀ ਦਾ ਮੇਲਾ", "ਲੋਹੜੀ ਦਾ ਮੇਲਾ", "ਦੀਵਾਲੀ", "ਹੋਲੀ"], "q": "Which is the Baisakhi fair?", "topic": "festivals", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "happy festival!", "explain": "ਤਿਉਹਾਰ ਦੀਆਂ ਵਧਾਈਆਂ! — ਵਧਾਈ = greeting.", "id": "pj-77", "lesson": "festivals", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["happy festival!", "happy journey!", "good morning!", "welcome home!"], "q": "'ਤਿਉਹਾਰ ਦੀਆਂ ਵਧਾਈਆਂ!' means…", "topic": "festivals", "type": "meaning"}, {"a": "ਮਿਠਿਆਈ ਖਾਓ", "explain": "ਮਿਠਿਆਈ ਖਾਓ — ਮਿਠਿਆਈ = sweets.", "id": "pj-78", "lesson": "festivals", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["ਮਿਠਿਆਈ ਖਾਓ", "ਰੋਟੀ ਖਾਓ", "ਪਾਣੀ ਪੀਓ", "ਚਾਹ ਪੀਓ"], "q": "Offer guests sweets. You say…", "topic": "festivals", "type": "usage"}, {"a": "gurdwara", "explain": "ਗੁਰਦੁਆਰਾ (gurduara) — the Sikh temple!", "id": "pj-79", "lesson": "festivals", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["gurdwara", "temple", "mosque", "church"], "q": "ਗੁਰਦੁਆਰਾ means…", "topic": "festivals", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "Sikh festival", "explain": "ਗੁਰਪੁਰਬ (gurpurab) — the Guru's birthday!", "id": "pj-80", "lesson": "festivals", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["Sikh festival", "Diwali", "Holi", "Dussehra"], "q": "ਗੁਰਪੁਰਬ is…", "topic": "festivals", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "light the lamp", "explain": "ਦੀਵਾ ਬਾਲੋ — ਦੀਵਾ = lamp.", "id": "pj-81", "lesson": "festivals", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["light the lamp", "close the door", "cook the food", "ring the bell"], "q": "'ਦੀਵਾ ਬਾਲੋ' means…", "topic": "festivals", "type": "meaning"}, {"a": "ਗੁਰਦੁਆਰੇ ਜਾਓ", "explain": "ਗੁਰਦੁਆਰੇ ਜਾਓ — ਗੁਰਦੁਆਰਾ = gurdwara.", "id": "pj-82", "lesson": "festivals", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["ਗੁਰਦੁਆਰੇ ਜਾਓ", "ਘਰ ਜਾਓ", "ਦੁਕਾਨ ਜਾਓ", "ਸਕੂਲ ਜਾਓ"], "q": "Say 'go to the gurdwara'. You say…", "topic": "festivals", "type": "usage"}, {"a": "hymn", "explain": "ਸ਼ਬਦ (shaba